        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Zn(OAc)2·2H2O (1 mmol, 0.220 g), Dy(NO3)3·5H2O (1 mmol, 0.440 g) and H3L (1 mmol, 0.297 g) were added in MeOH (15 ml) in the presence of NEt3 (1 mmol, 0.140 ml). The mixture was transferred to a Teflon-lined autoclave (23 ml) and kept at 95 °C for 12 h under solvothermal conditions (aerobic). After slow cooling to room temperature at 20 °C h−1, pale yellow crystals of 1·4MeOH were obtained, collected by filtration, washed with Et2O and dried in air.",
